                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "We do not have a set policy, but we tend to enable common features. Dump feels like a common feature. This has sat long enough."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Paul Fertser",
                        "email": "fercerpav@gmail.com",
                        "username": "paulfertser"
                    },
                    "message": "It is apparently a somewhat common feature but what bothers me is that it's not enabled by default in `bmcweb`. Not like it'd crash the UI even if somebody tries to use it without backend support of course, so adding it to the menu shouldn't be too bad. Probably it'll motivate more companies to check the functionality and enable it and contribute to it even."
                }
